      "statement": "Kyverno 1.13 drops the deprecated kyverno.io/v2alpha1 API versions of the CleanupPolicy, ClusterCleanupPolicy and PolicyException CRDs, and existing resources at the dropped versions must be migrated — automatically by the Helm chart's migration hook, or via kube-storage-version-migrator when upgrading without Helm (or without the hook)."
    },
