      "statement": "Kyverno 1.13 drops kyverno.io/v2alpha1 from the CleanupPolicy, ClusterCleanupPolicy and PolicyException CRDs. Exposed: environments whose manifests still use v2alpha1 for these kinds, or whose CRD status.storedVersions still lists v2alpha1. Those stored objects must be migrated, either by the Helm hook or by kube-storage-version-migrator."
